WEBVTT

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:01.537
The father's job is to teach his
children how to be warriors,

00:09:01.829 --> 00:09:04.204
to give them the confidence
to get on the horse,

00:09:04.204 --> 00:09:07.204
to ride into battle when it's
necessary to do so.

00:09:07.662 --> 00:09:11.537
If you don't get that from your father,
you have to teach yourself.

00:09:11.621 --> 00:09:16.787
Well, that's so resonated with me. What do
you think you had to teach yourself?

00:09:16.787 --> 00:09:19.662
Like, what is the biggest thing you
think you had to teach yourself?

00:09:20.246 --> 00:09:25.037
Oh, you don't ask little questions,
do you? You asked me questions.

00:09:25.662 --> 00:09:28.496
Big questions, sorry. Big questions.